[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15540.63, "timestamp": "04:19:00", "text": "这个名字还有另一层含义。不。所以我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15543.67, "timestamp": "04:19:03", "text": "我的想法是给予"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15546.229, "timestamp": "04:19:06", "text": "呃，我的想法是给星座们"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15549.853, "timestamp": "04:19:09", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i thought its about concert or something"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15550.07, "timestamp": "04:19:10", "text": "音乐会餐盘对我来说意义非凡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15551.83, "timestamp": "04:19:11", "text": "粉丝名。不，它是一个社区"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15554.87, "timestamp": "04:19:14", "text": "姓名。所以我在考虑要不要给它一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15558.149, "timestamp": "04:19:18", "text": "意思是随着时间的推移。我们没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15560.149, "timestamp": "04:19:20", "text": "吉祥物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15562.79, "timestamp": "04:19:22", "text": "呃，社区的人物形象"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15565.51, "timestamp": "04:19:25", "text": "音乐会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15569.91, "timestamp": "04:19:29", "text": "然而。嗯，但是未来在我之后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15572.07, "timestamp": "04:19:32", "text": "首秀已经完成，新车型和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15574.07, "timestamp": "04:19:34", "text": "一切都完成了。不，将来我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15578.87, "timestamp": "04:19:38", "text": "打算弄个吉祥物什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15581.269, "timestamp": "04:19:41", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15583.99, "timestamp": "04:19:43", "text": "所以，大家的想法都是给予"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15587.03, "timestamp": "04:19:47", "text": "每个人都像音乐会一样拥有独特的身份"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15590.149, "timestamp": "04:19:50", "text": "星盘，又称星座。所以你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15592.309, "timestamp": "04:19:52", "text": "选择你想要的星座类型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15596.95, "timestamp": "0